      "text": "Prompt \u2192 image idea \u2192 ASCII render\n\nVector store can suggest visuals from lyric meaning:\n\u2022 semantic theme lookup\n\u2022 cached motif per song\n\u2022 beat/mood animated blocks\n\nKeep optional/offline-safe.",
